{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15080","headline":"上元日梦王母献白玉环 · 张佐","name":"上元日梦王母献白玉环","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梦中朝上日，阙下拜天颜。\n彷佛瞻王母，分明献玉环。\n灵姿趋甲帐，悟道契玄关。\n似见霜姿白，如看月彩弯。\n霓裳归物外，凤历晓人寰。\n仙圣非相远，昭昭寤寐间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张佐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15080.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15080","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}